{"id":"n46603-2-8","stage":2,"title":"도중 · 进行中","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n46603-2-8-1","ko":"식사 도중에 어딜 가는 게냐.","zh":"吃饭的时候你要去哪儿啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"식사","meaning":"用餐，就餐，餐","explanation":"식사：用餐，就餐，餐","readings":[{"term":"식사","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29596","senseId":"1","lemma":"식사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식사","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3"}},{"text":"도중에","meaning":"进行中，中","explanation":"도중：进行中，中；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"도중","audio":"/audio/6c9698976625ced8afcc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46603","senseId":"2","lemma":"도중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도중에","audio":"/audio/fbf955c65aba162534eb.mp3"}},{"text":"어딜","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어딜","audio":"/audio/f10fe3683e3b73b1fa52.mp3"}},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가는","audio":"/audio/4df15b29e7ed7afe1cce.mp3"}},{"text":"게냐.","meaning":"是……吗？（询问行为）","explanation":"게냐 是 것이냐 的缩略形式；가는 게냐 在这里询问“这是要去哪儿”，不是预测或计划。句末 -냐 是对亲近者或晚辈使用的疑问形式。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게냐","audio":"/audio/9ab70a21e912cfbbaa50.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0f82e313dadba4d8","term":"식사","zh":"用餐，就餐，餐","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3","entryId":"29596","definition":"像早餐、午餐、晚餐那样每天在固定时间吃饭；或指那时吃的食物。","pronunciation":["식싸"]},{"id":"6c9698976625ced8","term":"도중","zh":"进行中，中","audio":"/audio/6c9698976625ced8afcc.mp3","entryId":"46603","definition":"事情正在进行的过程中。","pronunciation":["도ː중"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"某种行为、状态或事情","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"某种行为、状态或事情","pronunciation":["걷"]}],"audio":"/audio/2d87969eee0a4895e2b6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n46603-2-8-2","ko":"잠시 화장실 좀 다녀올게요.","zh":"我先去趟洗手间，马上回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잠시","meaning":"片刻，暂时","explanation":"잠시：片刻，暂时","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71203","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}},{"text":"화장실","meaning":"洗手间，卫生间","explanation":"화장실：洗手间，卫生间","readings":[{"term":"화장실","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30211","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화장실","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀올게요.","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀올게요","audio":"/audio/af6ec491241962459507.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6fcdfa8c124ab5cb","term":"잠시","zh":"片刻，暂时","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3","entryId":"71203","definition":"一小会儿。","pronunciation":["잠ː시"]},{"id":"477b8e1cccfde276","term":"화장실","zh":"洗手间，卫生间","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3","entryId":"30211","definition":"设有供大便和小便排出体外的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["화장실"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c28edc3d90b7f1fd6584.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.718,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=46603","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":63,"sequenceScore":1.4433,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我先去趟洗手间，马上回来。","我正在考虑在咱们小区开家咖啡馆。","吃饭的时候你要去哪儿啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我先去趟洗手间，马上回来。","吃饭的时候你要去哪儿啊？","我正在考虑在咱们小区开家咖啡馆。"],"answer":0}]}
